    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for saying that. i was really worried it might be something serious like a stroke or something since it happens so fast. but if it's just stress, do you think there's anything i can take to help clear it up? like maybe some extra supplements or something to help my focus so i can get through my work week?",
