      "content": "While supplements can't magically cure fatigue or stress, some may help alleviate symptoms. Consider trying omega-3 fatty acids, which support brain health, or vitamin B12, as deficiencies can contribute to mental fogginess. Additionally, adaptogenic herbs like ashwagandha or ginseng may help mitigate stress and promote mental clarity. However, it's always best to consult with a healthcare professional before adding any new supplements to your routine, as they can interact with medications or have underlying health concerns.",
